# 11. ME AND MY CREW

Create a major universe/character section.

Title:

# ME AND MY CREW

Subtitle:

> Every witness carries a name.
> Every name carries a story.

Characters must not look like ordinary team members.

They are **entities inside the MoonWitness universe**.

Use a cinematic character registry.

Each character should have:

- index
- primary name
- aliases
- title
- witness statement
- skills
- visual signature
- story
- status

