# 21. CREW CONSTELLATION

Create an interactive visualization connecting all crew members.

The characters should appear as nodes.

THE SHADOW should be the central node.

Other characters orbit/connect through lines.

Lines represent:

- relationship
- witness
- story
- influence
- message
- unknown connection

Hovering a node should illuminate its connections.

Clicking a node opens the character story.

This should become one of the signature MoonWitness visual experiences.

---

# 22. THE MESSAGE SYSTEM

MoonWitness is ultimately about:

**sharing a message.**

Create a central message component.

Example:

> WHEN THE MOON WITNESS
> WE SHARE A MESSAGE.

Messages should feel like transmissions.

Possible UI:

SIGNAL DETECTED

MESSAGE RECEIVED

WITNESS RECORDED

STORY OPENED

EXPOSURE ACTIVE

Do not overuse these labels.

