- SignalLines
- StorySection
- ExposureSection
- ChangeAdvisoryBoard
- EmotionalModule
- CrewConstellation
- CrewMember
- CharacterProfile
- MessageTransmission
- ArchiveTimeline
- SignalIndicator

Do not duplicate large blocks of JSX.

Keep components maintainable.

---

# 29. DATA ARCHITECTURE

Character data should NOT be hardcoded repeatedly inside UI components.

Create a structured data source.

Example conceptual structure:

character:

- id
- name
- aliases
- title
- witness
- birth
- skills
- ultimateSkill
- description
- visualSignature
- connections

This allows MoonWitness to grow later.

---

# 30. DESIGN TOKENS

Create a consistent design-token system.

Define:

- background
- foreground
- muted
- border
- signal
- electric
- warning
- typography
- spacing
- radius
- shadows
- animation duration

Do not scatter arbitrary values throughout the application.

---

# 31. PERFORMANCE

Prioritize:

- fast initial load
- lazy loading where useful
- efficient animations
- CSS transforms over expensive layout operations
- limited particle count
- no unnecessary dependencies

Do not install a new library unless genuinely necessary.

---

# 32. CONTENT RULES

Preserve the supplied MoonWitness terminology.

Do not automatically sanitize the universe into generic corporate language.

However:

- fix obvious spelling inconsistencies only when necessary
- preserve aliases
- preserve fictional character concepts
- preserve the mysterious tone
- do not invent biographies
- do not invent factual claims
- do not invent relationships that were not provided

If information is missing:

use UNKNOWN / UNRECORDED rather than inventing content.

---

# 33. IMPORTANT RELIGIOUS REPRESENTATION RULE

MoonWitness may contain religious references.

Do NOT visually depict:

- Allah
- Prophet Muhammad
- other sacred figures when the representation would be inappropriate

Use:

- names
- text
- typography
- abstract light
- abstract geometry
- symbolic lines

Never generate a literal human depiction of Allah or Prophet Muhammad.

---

