# 37. IMPLEMENTATION WORKFLOW

Follow this exact sequence.

### STEP 1 — INSPECT

Inspect the entire relevant project structure.

Identify:

- application entry
- routes
- layouts
- components
- CSS
- theme
- assets
- package configuration
- existing design system

### STEP 2 — PLAN

Create a concise implementation plan based on the actual repository.

Do not rewrite working infrastructure unnecessarily.

### STEP 3 — DESIGN SYSTEM

Establish MoonWitness tokens and visual primitives.

### STEP 4 — BUILD HERO

Implement the MoonWitness hero and line-based visual identity.

### STEP 5 — BUILD STORY SYSTEM

Implement Storytelling + Exposure.

### STEP 6 — BUILD BOARD

Implement Change Advisory Board.

### STEP 7 — BUILD EMOTIONAL MODULES

Implement:

- Chasing Heart
- Lovestruck
- Breath Electric

### STEP 8 — BUILD CREW

Implement:

- structured character data
- character components
- Crew Constellation
- character detail experience

### STEP 9 — BUILD ARCHIVE

Implement the archive/timeline experience.

### STEP 10 — RESPONSIVE

Test desktop, tablet and mobile.

### STEP 11 — ACCESSIBILITY

Test keyboard navigation, contrast and reduced motion.

### STEP 12 — PERFORMANCE

Remove unnecessary animations/dependencies and optimize rendering.

### STEP 13 — VALIDATION

Run the project's existing:

- lint
- typecheck
- test
- build

commands.

Fix all errors introduced by your implementation.

